1
00:00:03,545 --> 00:00:06,837
Hey, Ueno, what kind of food do you like?

2
00:00:11,094 --> 00:00:12,514
Why do you ask?

3
00:00:12,597 --> 00:00:15,234
The guys from our hiring
batch are grabbing drinks soon.

4
00:00:15,317 --> 00:00:17,117
Just trying to figure
out where we should go.

5
00:00:18,217 --> 00:00:19,517
Oh...

6
00:00:22,564 --> 00:00:24,124
I'm not going, so don't worry about me.

7
00:00:25,397 --> 00:00:26,534
Anyway.

8
00:00:26,617 --> 00:00:27,917
I'm heading out.

9
00:00:29,477 --> 00:00:31,006
Oh, wait up!

10
00:00:32,137 --> 00:00:33,617
Let's walk out together.

11
00:00:41,457 --> 00:00:42,954
Hey, listen.

12
00:00:43,037 --> 00:00:47,817
When I crashed at your place last time,
what brand was that toner you used?

13
00:00:49,217 --> 00:00:51,714
Just some basic drugstore brand.

14
00:00:51,797 --> 00:00:53,354
Oh, really?

15
00:00:53,437 --> 00:00:55,734
You seem to know a lot about skincare.

16
00:00:55,817 --> 00:00:57,197
Got any recommendations?

17
00:00:58,857 --> 00:01:01,517
I'm not great at talking about myself.

18
00:01:02,637 --> 00:01:05,877
And I hate it when people
pry into my personal life.

19
00:01:14,957 --> 00:01:16,917
When's your birthday, Ueno?

20
00:01:33,857 --> 00:01:35,557
What kind of music do you listen to?

21
00:01:41,637 --> 00:01:43,757
What do you do on your days off?

22
00:01:45,177 --> 00:01:47,394
Does he actually care?

23
00:01:47,477 --> 00:01:48,777
About all that stuff?

24
00:01:49,837 --> 00:01:53,777
If he found out I was gay,
that'd probably shut him right up.

25
00:02:00,597 --> 00:02:01,897
Hey, so...

26
00:02:02,957 --> 00:02:04,257
That guy you're looking for...

27
00:02:05,017 --> 00:02:06,417
Why can't it be me?

28
00:02:08,417 --> 00:02:09,717
Just throwing it out there...

29
00:02:15,477 --> 00:02:16,777
Huh?

30
00:02:17,317 --> 00:02:18,617
I mean,

31
00:02:19,237 --> 00:02:21,317
if you're looking for someone like that,

32
00:02:21,877 --> 00:02:23,517
wouldn't it be way easier with me?

33
00:02:24,977 --> 00:02:26,234
Wait...

34
00:02:26,317 --> 00:02:27,394
Hold on.

35
00:02:27,477 --> 00:02:28,957
Where is this coming from?

36
00:02:29,577 --> 00:02:31,754
Instead of swiping on dating apps...

37
00:02:31,837 --> 00:02:33,137
Look, I...

38
00:02:34,677 --> 00:02:36,517
I like you.

39
00:02:38,557 --> 00:02:40,017
So, what do you say?

40
00:02:42,617 --> 00:02:44,017
You say you like me...

41
00:02:45,517 --> 00:02:46,817
Wait, you mean...

42
00:02:49,417 --> 00:02:51,334
Wait, do you...

43
00:02:51,417 --> 00:02:53,074
not find me attractive at all?

44
00:02:53,157 --> 00:02:54,514
Am I not your type?

45
00:02:54,597 --> 00:02:55,734
No,

46
00:02:55,817 --> 00:02:57,437
that's beside the point.

47
00:02:59,721 --> 00:03:01,849
You're moving way too fast.

48
00:03:01,932 --> 00:03:04,893
Just drink some water and cool off...

49
00:03:07,377 --> 00:03:08,594
What are you doing?

50
00:03:08,677 --> 00:03:09,977
Sorry.

51
00:03:13,897 --> 00:03:15,197
Still,

52
00:03:18,407 --> 00:03:19,800
in your eyes, Ueno...

53
00:03:23,657 --> 00:03:25,497
do I stand a chance?

54
00:03:28,057 --> 00:03:29,357
Or is it a hard pass?

55
00:03:34,717 --> 00:03:37,008
You're not even gay.

56
00:03:38,917 --> 00:03:40,887
Do you really want to know the answer?

57
00:03:44,933 --> 00:03:46,226
Yeah, I do.

58
00:04:00,537 --> 00:04:01,837
God...

59
00:04:02,377 --> 00:04:03,817
I'm so into him.

60
00:04:07,497 --> 00:04:08,934
I think

61
00:04:09,017 --> 00:04:10,757
I always have been.

62
00:04:15,237 --> 00:04:17,334
Wait, with two guys...

63
00:04:17,417 --> 00:04:18,717
how does this even work?

64
00:04:20,297 --> 00:04:21,597
Hey.

65
00:04:22,554 --> 00:04:24,222
Get off me first...

66
00:04:25,277 --> 00:04:26,577
Screw it.

67
00:04:27,097 --> 00:04:28,397
I don't even care anymore.

68
00:04:34,197 --> 00:04:35,497
Wait...

69
00:04:36,157 --> 00:04:37,457
Hold on!

70
00:04:55,045 --> 00:04:56,296
Hey!

71
00:05:13,037 --> 00:05:14,998
Not half bad, right?

72
00:05:39,339 --> 00:05:40,966
Ueno...

73
00:05:59,359 --> 00:06:03,154
That wasn't a dream, right?

74
00:06:04,781 --> 00:06:06,950
When he held me tight,

75
00:06:07,857 --> 00:06:10,717
it felt like he wanted me
with everything he had.

76
00:06:11,837 --> 00:06:16,001
And I realized, this
is all I've ever wanted.

77
00:06:18,557 --> 00:06:21,217
So this is what it feels like to let
your guard down with someone.

78
00:06:26,970 --> 00:06:29,117
Ow...

79
00:06:34,394 --> 00:06:35,854
(Shirai: Kanda-san!!!!! )

80
00:06:35,937 --> 00:06:37,817
(I got a winning stick
on my kinako candy!!!! )

81
00:06:41,776 --> 00:06:44,154
Why are you telling me?!

82
00:06:51,661 --> 00:06:53,674
(Ueno: What happened? Where are you?)

83
00:06:53,757 --> 00:06:55,057
After that,

84
00:06:56,373 --> 00:06:59,813
I pretty much just left
without saying much.

85
00:07:02,631 --> 00:07:04,999
I wonder what's going through his head.

86
00:08:30,300 --> 00:08:32,900
"You Should Be The One To Come Kiss Me"

87
00:08:33,763 --> 00:08:37,857
(Episode 5 )

88
00:08:48,194 --> 00:08:49,194
Man...

89
00:08:53,153 --> 00:08:54,453
Ugh...

90
00:08:56,257 --> 00:08:57,912
Ugh!

91
00:08:58,817 --> 00:09:00,717
Maybe I should just call
it a day and go home.

92
00:09:01,557 --> 00:09:02,694
Sounds like a plan.

93
00:09:02,777 --> 00:09:03,777
Mind if I tag along?

94
00:09:03,857 --> 00:09:05,157
Not a chance.

95
00:09:05,737 --> 00:09:08,799
You still haven't given me the
handouts for tomorrow's meeting.

96
00:09:08,882 --> 00:09:11,254
Working on it as fast as I can!

97
00:09:11,337 --> 00:09:14,954
Actually, I'm still waiting on
the list of questions from PR.

98
00:09:15,037 --> 00:09:16,337
Why are we waiting on PR?

99
00:09:17,617 --> 00:09:20,957
Since it involves the local government,
Mizoguchi-san is joining us tomorrow.

100
00:09:22,617 --> 00:09:24,337
Didn't we just go over this in the morning?

101
00:09:24,917 --> 00:09:26,217
Oh.

102
00:09:27,067 --> 00:09:28,360
Right.

103
00:09:28,443 --> 00:09:30,234
Yeah, rings a bell.

104
00:09:30,317 --> 00:09:31,334
My bad.

105
00:09:31,417 --> 00:09:33,714
I'm gonna go grab some lunch.

106
00:09:33,797 --> 00:09:35,097
Huh?

107
00:09:37,517 --> 00:09:38,817
Kanda-san?

108
00:10:09,957 --> 00:10:10,894
Excuse me.

109
00:10:10,977 --> 00:10:13,117
Could I send this
document back for revision?

110
00:10:17,826 --> 00:10:19,417
Guess he's tied up.

111
00:10:29,117 --> 00:10:30,714
Kanda-san.

112
00:10:30,797 --> 00:10:32,097
Wanna eat together?

113
00:10:32,717 --> 00:10:34,017
Sure.

114
00:10:38,577 --> 00:10:39,877
Thanks.

115
00:10:42,617 --> 00:10:44,770
Man...

116
00:10:44,853 --> 00:10:47,957
General Affairs sent out
a company-wide email.

117
00:10:49,237 --> 00:10:51,397
Why hasn't he texted me at all?

118
00:10:52,277 --> 00:10:53,997
Not that I've reached out either.

119
00:10:54,817 --> 00:10:57,194
Still, after everything that happened...

120
00:10:57,277 --> 00:10:58,577
Normally, you'd...

121
00:11:02,717 --> 00:11:03,934
Did you go all the way?

122
00:11:04,017 --> 00:11:05,874
No!

123
00:11:05,957 --> 00:11:07,274
I knew it.

124
00:11:07,357 --> 00:11:10,114
That survey is way too long, right?

125
00:11:10,197 --> 00:11:11,894
I gave up halfway through, too.

126
00:11:11,977 --> 00:11:13,957
Oh, you meant that.

127
00:11:18,057 --> 00:11:19,657
Wait, are we just friends with benefits?

128
00:11:20,805 --> 00:11:22,098
Am I just a hookup to him?

129
00:11:22,724 --> 00:11:25,597
I mean, I did make it sound like
I was fine just being a stand-in.

130
00:11:27,857 --> 00:11:29,157
Hey, guess what?

131
00:11:29,697 --> 00:11:30,997
On my next day off,

132
00:11:31,757 --> 00:11:34,986
I'm hanging out with my crush.

133
00:11:41,657 --> 00:11:42,997
No appetite?

134
00:11:43,637 --> 00:11:45,897
If you're not gonna eat that, I'll take it.

135
00:11:47,457 --> 00:11:49,751
Oh...

136
00:11:49,834 --> 00:11:52,003
Yeah, go ahead...

137
00:12:36,339 --> 00:12:37,632
Whoa, stop...

138
00:12:38,637 --> 00:12:40,385
You're creeping me out.

139
00:12:50,857 --> 00:12:53,134
- Let's get omurice.
- Oh, sounds good.

140
00:12:53,217 --> 00:12:55,494
I'm craving Italian today.

141
00:12:55,577 --> 00:12:56,276
Ooh, that works too.

142
00:12:56,359 --> 00:12:59,571
I wanna take lots of cute pics.

143
00:12:59,654 --> 00:13:02,115
Let's find somewhere trendy...

144
00:13:06,837 --> 00:13:08,114
Oh.

145
00:13:08,197 --> 00:13:09,374
Sorry!

146
00:13:09,457 --> 00:13:11,034
My last meeting ran way over.

147
00:13:11,117 --> 00:13:12,977
We're short on time, so I
went ahead and called a cab.

148
00:13:13,001 --> 00:13:14,335
Awesome, you're a lifesaver.

149
00:13:17,037 --> 00:13:18,337
Oh.

150
00:13:19,132 --> 00:13:21,954
Mind if I ride shotgun?

151
00:13:22,037 --> 00:13:23,914
I'll hop in the back then.

152
00:13:23,997 --> 00:13:25,297
Sure.

153
00:13:27,517 --> 00:13:29,017
You don't have to do that.

154
00:13:34,317 --> 00:13:35,817
Force of habit...

155
00:13:42,317 --> 00:13:43,094
All right.

156
00:13:43,177 --> 00:13:47,577
I also brought Mizoguchi
from our PR department today.

157
00:13:47,660 --> 00:13:49,314
Allow me to introduce her.

158
00:13:49,397 --> 00:13:51,454
May I introduce myself?

159
00:13:51,537 --> 00:13:52,254
Please, go ahead.

160
00:13:52,337 --> 00:13:53,697
It's a pleasure to meet you.

161
00:13:55,397 --> 00:13:57,394
Heading back to the office too, Kanda-san?

162
00:13:57,477 --> 00:14:00,374
No, I have to swing by Lanau Corp next.

163
00:14:00,457 --> 00:14:01,817
You two go on ahead.

164
00:14:02,617 --> 00:14:04,635
Rough schedule.

165
00:14:10,757 --> 00:14:12,354
Hey, quick question.

166
00:14:12,437 --> 00:14:14,080
That ex you slept with
before making it official...

167
00:14:14,105 --> 00:14:17,162
how long did it take for you
guys to actually start dating?

168
00:14:17,437 --> 00:14:18,737
Whoa, where is this coming from?

169
00:14:21,037 --> 00:14:22,437
Well, let's see...

170
00:14:25,037 --> 00:14:28,052
Not really a topic for broad daylight
in the middle of the business district.

171
00:14:28,076 --> 00:14:30,174
Save it for our next drinks.

172
00:14:30,257 --> 00:14:32,454
Oh, right, sorry!

173
00:14:32,537 --> 00:14:33,694
How about tonight...

174
00:14:33,777 --> 00:14:37,857
No good, I've got another
work dinner tomorrow.

175
00:14:39,137 --> 00:14:40,294
I'll text you.

176
00:14:40,377 --> 00:14:41,274
Got it.

177
00:14:41,357 --> 00:14:43,034
Anyway, good work today, you two.

178
00:14:43,117 --> 00:14:43,834
See ya.

179
00:14:43,917 --> 00:14:45,217
Good work today.

180
00:14:51,557 --> 00:14:53,117
You totally heard all that, didn't you?

181
00:14:54,617 --> 00:14:56,117
Loud and clear.

182
00:14:58,477 --> 00:15:00,291
Boy's losing his cool.

183
00:15:06,717 --> 00:15:08,449
Didn't you say we should stay out of it?

184
00:15:12,657 --> 00:15:15,290
Yeah, I know, I know.

185
00:15:15,373 --> 00:15:18,997
I just really hope Kanda-san
doesn't get his heart broken.

186
00:15:21,657 --> 00:15:23,437
Since when did you get so soft?

187
00:15:24,657 --> 00:15:26,617
Unlike me, he seems pretty sensitive.

188
00:15:30,917 --> 00:15:32,394
Don't sweat it.

189
00:15:32,477 --> 00:15:35,894
If he ends up in tears, I'll
give him a shoulder to cry on.

190
00:15:35,977 --> 00:15:38,857
Damn, Mizoguchi-san, you're such a badass.

191
00:15:40,197 --> 00:15:42,517
Yeah, right.

192
00:15:43,357 --> 00:15:47,814
Looking at Kanda right now reminds me
of my younger self. It's painful to watch.

193
00:15:47,897 --> 00:15:51,597
I honestly can't picture you being
anything less than cool, Mizoguchi-san.

194
00:15:53,797 --> 00:15:55,937
Let's keep it that way.

195
00:16:22,037 --> 00:16:25,777
At first, I didn't think Kanda
and I would get along at all.

196
00:16:27,361 --> 00:16:28,654
Whether it was our mindset,

197
00:16:29,217 --> 00:16:31,337
or the way we communicate.

198
00:16:36,937 --> 00:16:39,414
Whatever happened to
grabbing drinks with our batch?

199
00:16:39,497 --> 00:16:40,794
Oh.

200
00:16:40,877 --> 00:16:42,754
We're just waiting on Ueno, right?

201
00:16:42,837 --> 00:16:44,462
Ah, Ueno...

202
00:16:44,545 --> 00:16:48,087
Stop bugging him. The guy's
running out of excuses to turn us down.

203
00:16:48,112 --> 00:16:50,937
True, it just makes things
awkward for everyone.

204
00:16:51,497 --> 00:16:53,317
I don't think it's a big deal.

205
00:16:53,997 --> 00:16:54,714
Huh?

206
00:16:54,797 --> 00:16:56,734
What do you mean?

207
00:16:56,817 --> 00:16:58,117
Well...

208
00:16:59,393 --> 00:17:00,833
I don't know him all that well yet, either.

209
00:17:00,857 --> 00:17:01,874
Come on, what gives?

210
00:17:01,957 --> 00:17:04,173
He's not a bad guy, though.

211
00:17:04,196 --> 00:17:05,496
He's really kind,

212
00:17:06,377 --> 00:17:08,496
and pretty deep once
you get talking to him.

213
00:17:09,516 --> 00:17:11,316
There's just something
interesting about him.

214
00:17:11,617 --> 00:17:14,217
The more you get to know him,
the more you want to find out.

215
00:17:15,397 --> 00:17:17,774
That trait really makes you
a natural for sales, Kanda.

216
00:17:17,857 --> 00:17:18,574
What trait?

217
00:17:18,657 --> 00:17:20,373
You want to get to know me?

218
00:17:21,040 --> 00:17:22,333
For real?

219
00:17:24,477 --> 00:17:25,777
Even though...

220
00:17:28,297 --> 00:17:30,837
Actually, I'm gay.

221
00:17:38,137 --> 00:17:39,437
You actually showed up?

222
00:17:40,417 --> 00:17:41,717
Is that a problem?

223
00:17:44,063 --> 00:17:46,140
Not really.

224
00:17:58,417 --> 00:18:00,094
Hey, check this out.

225
00:18:00,177 --> 00:18:01,597
This is hilarious.

226
00:18:15,677 --> 00:18:17,263
Before I knew it,

227
00:18:18,764 --> 00:18:20,491
he became someone special to me.

228
00:18:37,917 --> 00:18:39,637
Oh, sorry.

229
00:18:47,077 --> 00:18:49,645
We need to talk.

230
00:18:59,317 --> 00:19:01,617
I'm sorry about what
happened the other day.

231
00:19:04,757 --> 00:19:06,134
Well...

232
00:19:06,217 --> 00:19:07,517
How do I put this?

233
00:19:09,023 --> 00:19:10,750
I'm gay,

234
00:19:11,617 --> 00:19:13,017
and I have physical urges, too.

235
00:19:13,957 --> 00:19:17,677
When a guy I trust touches
me, my body just reacts naturally.

236
00:19:19,977 --> 00:19:21,477
But I don't want us to start dating

237
00:19:22,077 --> 00:19:24,317
just because we got caught
up in the heat of the moment.

238
00:19:28,217 --> 00:19:29,794
Because to me,

239
00:19:29,877 --> 00:19:31,877
you really matter.

240
00:19:32,417 --> 00:19:34,217
I want us to be friends for life.

241
00:19:39,737 --> 00:19:41,037
So...

242
00:19:43,277 --> 00:19:44,677
Can we just pretend

243
00:19:45,237 --> 00:19:47,077
that night never happened?

244
00:19:56,877 --> 00:19:58,177
I see.

245
00:20:06,577 --> 00:20:07,877
Got it.

246
00:20:09,542 --> 00:20:13,017
Sorry you felt like you
had to go along with me.

247
00:20:14,797 --> 00:20:16,097
That's not...

248
00:20:17,049 --> 00:20:20,817
I really do like you.

249
00:20:22,537 --> 00:20:24,457
I honestly thought we might have a shot.

250
00:20:29,797 --> 00:20:31,797
Guess things aren't that simple, huh?

251
00:20:36,337 --> 00:20:38,877
Anyway, I'm gonna head out for today.

252
00:20:59,337 --> 00:21:00,637
Oh, right.

253
00:21:02,177 --> 00:21:04,277
Here, take this back.

254
00:21:06,873 --> 00:21:08,273
Wait, what?

255
00:21:26,952 --> 00:21:30,237
Let's just keep things normal
starting tomorrow, okay?

256
00:21:53,597 --> 00:21:55,597
I figured if it was Ueno,
we could make this work.

257
00:22:00,277 --> 00:22:02,279
Maybe

258
00:22:04,865 --> 00:22:07,993
if we just stay friends,

259
00:22:08,697 --> 00:22:10,357
everything will be fine.

260
00:23:36,717 --> 00:23:37,717
Oh.

261
00:23:39,043 --> 00:23:40,920
That's the thing Ueno has at his place.

262
00:23:41,003 --> 00:23:42,439
(Trending on social media: Moving Sand Art)

263
00:23:42,463 --> 00:23:44,303
(Every flip creates a
one-of-a-kind landscape)

264
00:23:51,857 --> 00:23:55,217
How am I supposed to
just act like normal friends?

265
00:23:59,697 --> 00:24:02,293
(Next Episode Preview) He's going to
run himself into the ground at this rate.

266
00:24:02,317 --> 00:24:03,954
You can come over to my place anytime.

267
00:24:04,037 --> 00:24:05,413
I'll give you the spare key back, too.

268
00:24:05,437 --> 00:24:07,446
Didn't I tell you I don't need it anymore?

269
00:24:07,529 --> 00:24:09,517
I want to understand Kanda.

270
00:24:10,377 --> 00:24:11,450
But...

271
00:24:11,533 --> 00:24:14,053
I'm still terrified.
